OL,3,GNEWSAFrom agriculture to AI-griculture:
OL,4,AHow tech is changing farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge McMaster's farming career
OL,7,Fstarted with milking eight cows in a
OL,8,Fbyre, relying on his eyes to spot any
OL,9,Fhealth issues in his cattle.
OL,11,FHe still watches his now-300-strong
OL,12,Fherd, but via a feed from an AI camera
OL,13,Fin the milking parlour at the farm near
OL,14,FIslandmagee in County Antrim.
OL,16,FThe device uses an algorithm which
OL,17,Fassigns each cow its own ID, records a
OL,18,Fshort video of the animal every day,
OL,19,Fanalyses it and flags any changes -
OL,20,Foften before they are visible to the
OL,21,Fhuman eye.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
