OL,3,GNEWSAFrom agriculture to AI-griculture:
OL,4,AHow tech is changing farming
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the third generation farmer, it is
OL,7,F"absolutely incredible to move from all
OL,8,Fhand-done to sitting on the phone,
OL,9,Fwatching what's happening outside".
